invariant: INV-62
file: mldsa_sign_pack.c
catches: test/lint-wide-multiply.sh
reason: RejBoundedPoly writes a kept half-byte by its index, behind a
  branch on whether it is kept, in place of the masked write to every
  position. The values are the same, so no test of a key sees it, but the
  branch reads the secret stream of s1 and s2, and its index the count of
  values kept. lint-wide-multiply's branch count for mldsa_sign_pack.c
  rises over its ceiling.

--- old
    store_at(p, *count, v, keep);
--- new
    if (keep != 0) {
        p->coeffs[*count] = v;
    }
